# Core: everyday desktop and CLI packages from Kali. One per line, # starts a comment.
# Port of the eos core.pacman list; see specs/packages.md for every rename and every
# dropped entry. Brave (vendor apt repo) and PeaZip (upstream .deb) are installed by
# modules/15-packages.sh, not from this list.

# Browser
firefox-esr

